%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#4F46E5'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Guest
    participant Widget as Reserve Widget
    participant API as Next.js API
    participant Capacity as Capacity Planner
    participant DB as Supabase
    participant Email as Email Service
    participant Queue as Redis Queue

    Note over Guest,Queue: Guest Booking Flow

    %% Step 1: Restaurant Selection
    Guest->>Widget: Select restaurant
    Widget->>API: GET /api/restaurants/[slug]
    API->>DB: Fetch restaurant config
    DB-->>API: Restaurant data + operating hours
    API-->>Widget: Restaurant details

    %% Step 2: Date & Party Size
    Guest->>Widget: Select date & party size
    Widget->>API: GET /api/restaurants/[slug]/availability
    API->>Capacity: Check availability
    Capacity->>DB: Query bookings + table allocations
    DB-->>Capacity: Current capacity state
    Capacity-->>API: Available time slots
    API-->>Widget: Time slot options

    %% Step 3: Time Selection
    Guest->>Widget: Select time slot
    Widget->>API: POST /api/bookings (soft hold)
    API->>Capacity: Create soft hold
    Capacity->>DB: Insert soft_holds record
    DB-->>Capacity: Hold confirmed
    Capacity-->>API: Hold ID + expiry
    API-->>Widget: Hold confirmation (5 min TTL)

    %% Step 4: Guest Details
    Guest->>Widget: Enter contact details
    Widget->>Widget: Validate (phone, email)

    %% Step 5: Confirmation
    Guest->>Widget: Confirm booking
    Widget->>API: POST /api/bookings (confirm)
    API->>Capacity: Convert hold to booking
    Capacity->>DB: Begin transaction
    Capacity->>DB: Insert booking record
    Capacity->>DB: Run table assignment
    DB-->>Capacity: Tables assigned
    Capacity->>DB: Insert allocations
    Capacity->>DB: Delete soft hold
    Capacity->>DB: Commit transaction
    Capacity-->>API: Booking confirmed
    
    %% Step 6: Post-booking
    API->>Queue: Enqueue confirmation email
    API-->>Widget: Booking details + confirmation code
    Widget-->>Guest: Success screen
    
    Queue->>Email: Process email job
    Email->>DB: Fetch booking + restaurant details
    Email->>Email: Render email template
    Email-->>Guest: Confirmation email sent

    Note over Guest,Queue: Realtime Updates (Ops Dashboard)
    
    DB--)API: Realtime: new booking event
    API--)Widget: Broadcast to ops dashboard
